@startuml pipeline
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam dpi 150
skinparam defaultFontName Helvetica
skinparam ArrowColor #34495E
skinparam activity {
  BackgroundColor #EAF1FB
  BorderColor #2E6DA4
  FontColor #15263F
  DiamondBackgroundColor #FDF2E0
  DiamondBorderColor #D9892B
}
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #F4FAF4
skinparam noteBorderColor #8BC28B

title Localization Convergent Validity — Pipeline & §11 Acceptance Gates\n(a phase is green only when it reproduces a published number, not when it runs)

start
:**Phase 0 — Environment & Parity**\nTransformerLens load (+nnsight fallback),\nSAE loader, chat-template content mask;
note right
  **Gates 11.0a–d**
  • TL <-> HF next-token KL < 1e-3
  • SAE reconstruction in published range + L0 sparsity
  • attention [b, 32, q, k], every row sums to 1
end note
if (parity gate 11.0b holds?) then (yes)
else (no)
  :switch to nnsight parity-exact fallback;
endif

:**Phase 1 — Signals & Within-Substrate Agreement**\naccum-attention, ported Wu heads, QRHead,\nITI, Orgad -> D(x) = 1 - mean pairwise Spearman;
note right
  **Gates 11.1a–e**
  • Wu reproduces published Llama-3.1-8B heads
  • top-N Wu ablation collapses NIAH (random ~ harmless)
  • gold-span decode fuzzy-matches >= 0.9, mask clean
end note

:**Phase 2 — Causal Oracle**\ntrue token ablation E(t),\nattribution-patching estimate E_hat;
note right
  **Gates 11.2a–d**
  • Spearman(E_hat, E) >= 0.8 (else subsampled ablation)
  • corruption-stability reported (token vs document swap)
  • gold-span ablation -> large answer-logit drop
end note

:**Phase 3 — Compression Flip-Test (the payoff)**\nH2O / SnapKV budget sweep,\nflip ~ D(x) + confounds (5-fold CV, LRT);
note right
  **Gates 11.3a–c**
  • eviction reproduces paper LongBench (within a few pts)
  • base flip rate in the 5–40% band
  • confound-only AUROC before D(x); leakage check passes
end note

:**Phase 4 — Replication**\nre-run 0–3 on gemma-2-9b-it + Gemma Scope 2;
stop

@enduml
